{"2549520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ViRd", "steam_appid": 2549520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From M.D.M.A, we are pleased to introduce our first VRBox: ViRd. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why walk when you can fly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step right up, folks, and relish in the achieved and exhilarating experience of flying by flapping your arms like a pigeon with psychomotor issues!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to delve into the intriguing depths of an existential crisis as you immerse yourself in the captivating aimlessness of the game, navigating the boundless skies above an abandoned, lifeless city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, come on down and revel in the excitement of it all. Let the adventure begin as you take flight in a city powered like no other by Unity's Asset Store, where the possibilities are as endless as the open sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celebrity reviews:</strong> (Parody)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It is a very complex time growing up, things are changing a lot at a very accelerated rate. We’re all aware of the effect of the internet online and life online.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cillian Murphy about internet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;When you make an omelet, as when you make love, affection counts for more than technique.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Isabel Allende</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From M.D.M.A, we are pleased to introduce our first VRBox: ViRd. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why walk when you can fly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step right up, folks, and relish in the achieved and exhilarating experience of flying by flapping your arms like a pigeon with psychomotor issues!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to delve into the intriguing depths of an existential crisis as you immerse yourself in the captivating aimlessness of the game, navigating the boundless skies above an abandoned, lifeless city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, come on down and revel in the excitement of it all. Let the adventure begin as you take flight in a city powered like no other by Unity's Asset Store, where the possibilities are as endless as the open sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celebrity reviews:</strong> (Parody)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It is a very complex time growing up, things are changing a lot at a very accelerated rate. We’re all aware of the effect of the internet online and life online.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cillian Murphy about internet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;When you make an omelet, as when you make love, affection counts for more than technique.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Isabel Allende</p>", "short_description": "Why walk when you can fly?Step right up, folks, and relish in the achieved and exhilarating experience of flying by flapping your arms like a pigeon with psychomotor issues!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549520/f27c4c5dc1d01b97c6b64a0e1e9ac768a1348c27/header.jpg?t=1787339810", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549520/492c58f7368416dd03a5c574fe36e427452edeed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787339810", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549520/492c58f7368416dd03a5c574fe36e427452edeed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787339810", "website": null, "pc_